[an|] integer means: @intrinsic("type", "int")

floating means: @intrinsic("type", "float")

fixed quantity means: @intrinsic("fix", quantity)

to accept {the wrapped type of 32:value}: @intrinsic("discard", value)

the wrapped type of value means: the type of value

function the type of {fixed floating:value}:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("discard", value)
        @intrinsic("type", "float", 32)

function the type of {fixed integer:value}:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("discard", value)
        @intrinsic("type", "int", 32)

accept 1
